---
source: tests/cli.rs
expression: "ok(dir.path(), &[\"kv-cache\", \"hybrid.gguf\", \"--ctx\", \"8192\"])"
---
KV cache estimate for hybrid.gguf (hybrid)

  block_count    4
  head_count     16
  head_count_kv  0-4 (4 per-layer entries)  KV heads in 2 of 4 layers
  key_length     64                         embedding_length 1024 / head_count 16
  value_length   64                         embedding_length 1024 / head_count 16
  cache type     f16                        2 bytes per element
  context        8,192                      tokens per sequence
  sequences      1

formula
  K per token = sum over layers of row_size(f16, head_count_kv[layer] x 64) = 1,024 B
  V per token = sum over layers of row_size(f16, head_count_kv[layer] x 64) = 1,024 B
  total = sequences x ctx x (K + V)
        = 1 x 8,192 x 2,048 B
        = 16,777,216 B (16.00 MiB)

notes
  - sliding-window attention (window 512): runtimes may cache fewer tokens for those layers; this is an upper bound
  - recurrent (SSM) state is not included
  - 2 layers have no KV heads
